# Eight loops stand side by side in the turn of one loop, and each holds a loop. None runs other code, which a first walk cannot know: each that is found quiet asks for another walk, and the wishes meet at the
# outermost loop. The walks grow with the width by a line: five for each loop side by side and two, as its twin of sixteen shows.
# RUN: compile WalksOfLoops mechanisms=all
# CHECK: statistic WalksOfLoops 42
